  "description": "Jagged Spur is a rugged Western-style display font forged with grit, boldness, and frontier spirit. Designed to echo the dust, leather, and lawlessness of the old West, this all-caps serif typeface is perfect for vintage posters, cowboy branding, outlaw-themed signage, bar logos, or any design project needing a touch of American grit. With distressed strokes, slab-style curves, and bold personality, Jagged Spur evokes the legacy of wild trails and silent loyalty where legends are born from dust and defiance.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Jagged Spur is a rugged Western-style display font forged with grit, boldness, and frontier spirit. Designed to echo the dust, leather, and lawlessness of the old West, this all-caps serif typeface is perfect for vintage posters, cowboy branding, outlaw-themed signage, bar logos, or any design project needing a touch of American grit. With distressed strokes, slab-style curves, and bold personality, Jagged Spur evokes the legacy of wild trails and silent loyalty where legends are born from dust and defiance.</p>",
